          CPU instructions: 
          0
        </p>
        <p>
          Memory bytes: 
          0
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
      >
        <div
          class="rounded border border-gray-200 bg-white/80 p-2 dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-900/50"
        >
          <p
            class="font-semibold uppercase text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100"
          >
            balance
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
          >
