          >
            proposal
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
          >
            Status update to Executed
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"
          >
            Before: Approved
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"
          >
